      "exact_behavior": "The exact nullable Tag Presentation control stages the default 4096, zero, finite values up to 10000000 and no limit until Apply. Typed persistence preserves old payload defaults and imports the legacy noneable integer. Real SearchPage tag computation counts the first N sorted thumbnail items before flattening collection members; selected items bypass the cap, and the cap notice appears only when the item count exceeds N. Sidebar captions match Qt, including tag-service qualification and human-formatted N. Sorting/rearrangement recalculates the prefix. Apply refreshes the active page, Cancel preserves saved settings, and reopening or activating a background page uses saved preferences.",
